        <item>
            <title>0.3.24</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 11:53:27 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/NeatMacApps/NeatWebApp</link>
            <sparkle:version>3042</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.24</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# NeatWebApp 0.3.24

- Improved floating Dock readability with larger app icons and a clear dotted drag grip.
- Prevented overlapping pinned browser windows from repeatedly stealing focus from each other.
- Restored public updates and strengthened release upload retries, recovery and full-download verification.

## 简体中文

- 放大悬浮 Dock 的应用图标，保留清晰的点阵拖动手柄。
- 修复交叠的置顶浏览器窗口反复抢焦点、闪烁的问题。
- 恢复公开更新，强化发布上传重试、失败续跑和完整下载验证。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/NeatMacApps/NeatWebApp/releases/download/v0.3.24/NeatWebApp-0.3.24.zip" length="5835569" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Qzy78BXzWqOToBRnerPm2fAbh6ADQ9Dvlj4X33JKW2TjLUWvFQdz5/z6/PXCPRN5R2VXbmo8IkgMOYZIWWIQAw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.3.23</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:37:30 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/NeatMacApps/NeatWebApp</link>
            <sparkle:version>3041</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.23</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# NeatWebApp 0.3.23

- Added a persistent two-column dotted grip to the floating activity Dock so its drag target is clear. The compact grip stays visible when app icons scroll and uses solid dots without hollow rings or blurred halos.
- Kept native free dragging and remembered placement; no collapse or expand controls.
- Shortened browser menu labels for faster scanning.

## 简体中文

- 悬浮活动 Dock 增加常驻双列点阵手柄，让拖动入口清晰可见；手柄区域保持紧凑，图标滚动时仍可见，使用实心圆点，去掉空心圈和模糊光晕。
- 保留原生自由拖动和位置记忆，不增加展开或收缩控件。
- 缩短浏览器菜单名称，便于快速查找。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/NeatMacApps/NeatWebApp/releases/download/v0.3.23/NeatWebApp-0.3.23.zip" length="5834376" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Ng6nAAKW2TkcJb2COZfQG9+yGpnoJ2jIHMyk16C/na5BBsedYdW95ftKCUa/utA3ySjdiXBjoF2yAIbBd/WgCw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.3.21</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 17:37:42 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/NeatMacApps/NeatWebApp</link>
            <sparkle:version>3039</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.21</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[NeatWebApp macOS 0.3.21

- 置顶窗口跟随鼠标自动聚焦：图钉置顶后，鼠标进入窗口即抢回焦点并聚焦网页，并排多应用切换输入更快；拖拽、启动盖未揭、有弹窗或按住鼠标时不抢。
- 刷新按钮改为重载当前页面，不再跳回首页。
- 新开网页应用更快：后台常备一个预热好的窗口进程，点开还没运行的网页应用时直接接手，省掉约 1.5 秒冷启动（实测从点击到网页请求发出由约 2 秒降到 0.4–0.5 秒）。
- 刘海启动器抽屉更好用：点黑底空白处收起，图标拖动换位跟手不跳动，拖到边缘自动滚动。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/NeatMacApps/NeatWebApp/releases/download/v0.3.21/NeatWebApp-0.3.21.zip" length="5846212" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Sizrt20R69tkJGjNlARJhGq/1V036My76WqBUGsq3uGJQPuBLKC9iYKh92jjK1EyDexeAa29XZUiZKAw/LzWCw=="/>
        </item>
